Z||000023||chester||11-11-2001||09:50 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Smoooooth GT:<BR><B>I mst say I love those wheel's.... What';s the brand and size of those??  lookin' good!!!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks Smoooooth,<P>The rims are made by Smiths Performance and are their Revolution series.  These are 17" x 7.5" <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigline.jpg">   <BR>Modified 2.8<BR>2.5" Drop<BR>11" Brakes<BR>17" Revolutions<BR>RCC Coilover Suspension||||reg||1
Z||000024||chester||11-11-2001||09:52 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Mickey_Moose:<BR><B>What does a script say on the lower panel of that black GT??<P>Tim</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>It says "Suspension by RCC/Carrera"<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000025||chester||11-11-2001||09:56 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 84fierotrevor:<BR><B>Ok I think i misundertood what shaving the door handles is.<BR>someone tell me what it does.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>By "shaving the door handles" you remove the factory handle and smooth it over.  Normally go to a electric actuator so you can either remotly open the door or mount a switch in a hidden location. Spring loaded plungers mounted under the door in the door frame pop the door open when you hit the button. <P>Rob D.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000026||Smoooooth GT||11-11-2001||11:13 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by chester:<BR><B> By "shaving the door handles" you remove the factory handle and smooth it over.  Normally go to a electric actuator so you can either remotly open the door or mount a switch in a hidden location. Spring loaded plungers mounted under the door in the door frame pop the door open when you hit the button. <P>Rob D.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>EXACTLY!!! I have the manual plunger button's right now... I also have power lock's sooo I plan on getting the remote lock--remote starter kit at a later time in order to lock the car!!! look's sweeeet with no handles, I must say!!  Steve<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Smooooth_Yellow_sig_3.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smooth_sig_blue_3.gif">  <BR>Shaved door hanles, sidetrim, exhaust outlet's, etc.... smooooth!!!||||reg||1
